# References

Thanks @ada for #123, which also closes sveltejs/kit#45. Landed in a1b2c3d.

Docs are at www.example.com/docs (or https://example.com/guide_one).

- an address, me@example.com, is not a mention
- an escaped one, \@bob, stays text
- in code, `@ada #123`, nothing happens
- [a link with @ada in it](/steps) keeps its text
